{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And Balaam said to the angel of HaShem, I have sinned.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory expounded: from here — whoever sins and says 'I have sinned,' the angel has no permission to touch him." "<b>For I did not know.</b> He had been praising himself, saying 'and knowing the knowledge of the Most High' (Numbers 24:16), and now he said 'I did not know.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:11.279983115Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}